---
import ResearchDemo from './ResearchDemo.astro';
import ResearchStarter from './ResearchStarter.astro';
---
<div id="finance-landing" class="not-content">
  <section class="hero-grid" aria-labelledby="_top">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true">●</span> OPEN-SOURCE FINANCIAL RESEARCH</p>
      <h1 id="_top">Good questions.<br />Real evidence.<br /><em>Your agent.</em></h1>
      <p class="intro">Give your AI agent the tools to research a company—and keep the sources behind its answer.</p>
      <p class="description">SEC filings, financial statements, document reading, and reproducible calculations. One CLI. A skill for the agent you already use.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="/FinanceCLI/ai/">Set up AI Skills <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#examples">Explore the workflow <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
      <p class="footnote">Runs locally. No paid key needed for SEC research.<br />Bring your own agent and model.</p>
      <div class="install"><span aria-hidden="true">$</span><code>pip install -U finresearch-cli</code><a href="/FinanceCLI/quickstart/" aria-label="Open installation guide">↗</a></div>
      <p class="install-note">Python 3.10+ <span>·</span> Apache-2.0 <span>·</span> No CLI usage telemetry</p>
    </div>
    <ResearchDemo />
  </section>

  <div class="capabilities" aria-label="Research capabilities"><span>BUILT FOR THE WORK BETWEEN QUESTION &amp; ANSWER</span><p>SEC filings <i>/</i> Financial statements <i>/</i> Documents <i>/</i> Calculations</p></div>

  <section id="examples" class="workflow" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE RESEARCH WORKFLOW</p><h2 id="workflow-title">From “tell me about…”<br />to <em>“show me where.”</em></h2><p>Your agent handles the reasoning. Finance CLI gives it the tools to find, read, and calculate. You can inspect every step.</p></div>
    <div class="workflow-grid">
      <article><span class="number">01 / ASK</span><h3>Start with your question.</h3><p>“How does Apple make money?” Your agent can choose the tools and follow up as the question develops.</p><a href="/FinanceCLI/ai/">Connect your agent ↗</a></article>
      <article><span class="number">02 / INVESTIGATE</span><h3>Go to the filing.</h3><p>Read company disclosures, inspect statement rows, and keep filing dates, source links, and missing data in view.</p><a href="/FinanceCLI/research-examples/">See research examples ↗</a></article>
      <article><span class="number">03 / VERIFY</span><h3>Keep the working.</h3><p>Calculations show their inputs and method. Save Markdown for reading or JSON to reuse in your next research step.</p><a href="/FinanceCLI/trust/">Explore the trust model ↗</a></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="proof" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">A RESULT YOU CAN REPRODUCE</p><h2 id="proof-title">The answer is useful.<br /><em>The working matters.</em></h2><p>If a value grows from 100 to 150 over three years, what is the annual compound growth rate?</p><a class="text-link" href="/FinanceCLI/research-examples/#check-a-growth-calculation">See the complete example ↗</a></div>
    <div class="calculation"><span class="number">ILLUSTRATIVE INPUTS · NO EXTERNAL DATA</span><p class="metric">14.47<span>%</span></p><p class="metric-label">Compound annual growth rate</p><div class="inputs"><span>START <b>100</b></span><span>END <b>150</b></span><span>YEARS <b>3</b></span></div><code>(150 / 100) ** (1 / 3) - 1</code></div>
  </section>

  <section class="terminal-section" aria-labelledby="terminal-title">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">ALSO MADE FOR YOUR TERMINAL</p><h2 id="terminal-title">Same tools.<br /><em>Your hands on the keyboard.</em></h2><p>Choose a question to build a command. Run it locally, keep the output, or pass it to your agent.</p><a class="text-link" href="/FinanceCLI/commands/">Browse all commands ↗</a></div>
    <ResearchStarter />
  </section>

  <section class="closing" aria-labelledby="closing-title"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT RESEARCH QUESTION STARTS HERE</p><h2 id="closing-title">Put evidence in<br /><em>your agent’s hands.</em></h2><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="/FinanceCLI/ai/">Get started with AI Skills ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/TempestShaw/FinanceCLI">Explore on GitHub ↗</a></div><p>Open source. Flexible tools. Research you can revisit.</p></section>
  <footer class="landing-footer"><a class="footer-brand" href="/FinanceCLI/">ƒ Finance CLI</a><p>For research and automation. Not investment advice.</p><div><a href="/FinanceCLI/quickstart/">Docs</a><a href="/FinanceCLI/data-sources/">Data sources</a><a href="https://github.com/TempestShaw/FinanceCLI/blob/main/README.zh-CN.md">简体中文</a></div></footer>
</div>

<style is:global>
  html:has(#finance-landing) { --sl-color-white: #16372d; --sl-color-gray-1: #243e31; --sl-color-gray-2: #4f6155; --sl-color-gray-4: #cfd8c9; --sl-color-gray-6: #f0f2e9; --sl-color-black: #f8f8f1; --sl-color-accent: #246441; --sl-content-width: 1200px; }
  html:has(#finance-landing) body { background: #f8f8f1; }
  html:has(#finance-landing) header { background: #f8f8f1f2 !important; }
  html:has(#finance-landing) main { padding-top: 0; }
  html:has(#finance-landing) main > .content-panel:first-child { display: none; }
  html:has(#finance-landing) main > .content-panel { border: 0; padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; }
  html:has(#finance-landing) .sl-container { max-width: 1200px; margin-inline: auto; }
  html:has(#finance-landing) .sl-container > .sl-markdown-content { margin: 0; }
  html:has(#finance-landing) .sl-markdown-content + footer { display: none; }
  #finance-landing { font-family: 'Avenir Next', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #16372d; }
  #finance-landing * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  #finance-landing .demo code { background: none; border: 0; padding: 0; }
  #finance-landing a { text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  #finance-landing .primary { background: #204d36; color: #fff; padding: .95rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 7px; text-decoration: none; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; transition: background .18s, transform .18s; }
  #finance-landing .primary:hover { background: #31694a; transform: translateY(-2px); }
  #finance-landing .text-link { color: #214b35; font-size: .86rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  #finance-landing .text-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  #finance-landing .actions { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  #finance-landing .eyebrow { font: .64rem/1.6 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .13em; color: #526847; }
  #finance-landing h1 { font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 5.4vw, 5rem); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -.065em; font-weight: 550; margin: 1.5rem 0; color: #16372d; }
  #finance-landing em { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; color: #4f6c3c; }
  #finance-landing h2 { letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  #finance-landing .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr; align-items: start; gap: 4rem; padding: 5rem 0 3.5rem; }
  #finance-landing .hero-copy { padding-top: 1.25rem; }
  #finance-landing .intro { font-size: 1.22rem; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 440px; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  #finance-landing .description { color: #647062; font-size: .93rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 435px; margin: 0 0 1.75rem; }
  #finance-landing .footnote { font-size: .74rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #62705d; margin: 1rem 0 2.2rem; }
  #finance-landing .install { display: flex; gap: .7rem; align-items: center; background: #ecefe3; border: 1px solid #d8dece; border-radius: 6px; padding: .85rem 1rem; max-width: 430px; }
  #finance-landing .install code { font-size: .76rem; border: 0; background: none; padding: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  #finance-landing .install a { margin-left: auto; color: #244a36; }
  #finance-landing .install-note { font: .6rem/1.6 ui-monospace, monospace; color: #687660; margin: .7rem 0; }
  #finance-landing .install-note span { padding: 0 .4rem; }
  #finance-landing .capabilities { border-block: 1px solid #d9dece; padding: 1.3rem 0; text-align: center; }
  #finance-landing .capabilities > span { font: .58rem ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .1em; color: #728068; }
  #finance-landing .capabilities p { font-size: .95rem; margin: .65rem 0 .1rem; }
  #finance-landing .capabilities i { font-style: normal; color: #adb89d; padding: 0 1.25rem; }
  #finance-landing .workflow { padding: 5.5rem 0; }
  #finance-landing .section-heading { max-width: 630px; }
  #finance-landing .section-heading h2, #finance-landing .proof h2, #finance-landing .terminal-section h2, #finance-landing .closing h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.12; margin: 1rem 0; }
  #finance-landing .section-heading > p:last-child, #finance-landing .proof p, #finance-landing .terminal-section > div > p { font-size: .94rem; color: #5b6b59; line-height: 1.8; }
  #finance-landing .workflow-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  #finance-landing .workflow-grid article { border-top: 1px solid #b8c6ad; padding-top: 1.25rem; }
  #finance-landing .number { font: .65rem ui-monospace, monospace; color: #637955; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  #finance-landing .workflow-grid h3 { font-size: 1.13rem; letter-spacing: -.035em; font-weight: 600; margin: 1.3rem 0 .7rem; }
  #finance-landing .workflow-grid p { color: #5c6e5a; font-size: .87rem; line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  #finance-landing .workflow-grid a { font-size: .78rem; color: #214b35; }
  #finance-landing .proof { background: #edf0e4; border: 1px solid #d8dfce; border-radius: 14px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; padding: 3rem; }
  #finance-landing .proof .eyebrow { font-size: .64rem; }
  #finance-landing .calculation { border-left: 1px solid #c9d2bf; padding-left: 3rem; }
  #finance-landing .calculation .metric { font-size: 5.6rem; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.07em; color: #214b35; margin: 1rem 0 0; font-weight: 450; }
  #finance-landing .metric span { font-size: 2.5rem; }
  #finance-landing .calculation .metric-label { font-size: .77rem; margin-top: 0; }
  #finance-landing .inputs { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-block: 1px solid #c9d2bf; padding: 1rem 0; margin: 1.3rem 0; font: .59rem ui-monospace, monospace; color: #5b6b50; }
  #finance-landing .inputs b { display: block; font: 1.2rem/1.8 'Avenir Next', sans-serif; color: #274b37; }
  #finance-landing .calculation code { font: .7rem ui-monospace, monospace; padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; color: #4c6543; }
  #finance-landing .terminal-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center; padding: 5rem 0; }
  #finance-landing .fc-starter { margin: 0; font-size: .85rem; background: #fffef8; }
  #finance-landing .fc-starter h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; }
  #finance-landing .fc-starter pre code { font-size: .72rem; }
  #finance-landing .closing { text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #d9dece; padding: 4rem 0 5rem; }
  #finance-landing .closing .actions { justify-content: center; margin-top: 1.8rem; }
  #finance-landing .closing > p:last-child { font-size: .75rem; color: #63745b; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  #finance-landing .landing-footer { border-top: 1px solid #d9dece; padding: 1.5rem 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; font-size: .7rem; color: #63705d; }
  #finance-landing .landing-footer a { color: #31513a; }
  #finance-landing .footer-brand { font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  #finance-landing .landing-footer div { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-left: auto; }
  @media(max-width: 1000px) { #finance-landing .hero-grid { gap: 2rem; } #finance-landing .actions { gap: 1rem; } }
  @media(max-width: 800px) { #finance-landing .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 2rem; } #finance-landing .hero-copy { padding-top: 0; } #finance-landing h1 { font-size: clamp(3.3rem, 9vw, 4.6rem); } #finance-landing .intro, #finance-landing .description { max-width: 600px; } #finance-landing .workflow-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; } #finance-landing .proof, #finance-landing .terminal-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; } #finance-landing .calculation { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid #c9d2bf; padding: 1.5rem 0 0; } #finance-landing .capabilities i { padding: 0 .35rem; } #finance-landing .landing-footer { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .7rem 1rem; } #finance-landing .landing-footer div { margin: 0; } }
  @media(max-width: 480px) { #finance-landing .proof { padding: 1.5rem; } #finance-landing .workflow, #finance-landing .terminal-section { padding-block: 3.5rem; } #finance-landing .capabilities p { font-size: .76rem; line-height: 1.9; } #finance-landing .eyebrow { font-size: .58rem; } #finance-landing .capabilities > span { font-size: .49rem; } }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { #finance-landing *, #finance-landing *::before, #finance-landing *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; } }
</style>
